{"id":1030803,"chapter_id":1030803,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"█编号：MBCC-SS-000-0807114\n█档案：禁闭者000调查报告后续\n\n*附录——过往追溯：\n……禁闭者000，双亲于入夜108年离世。后被新城地下组织“黑网”的首脑以虚假身份收养。","style":10,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"108年-112年这四年间，该组织一直利用000的黑客技术赚取不法收入。\n\n包括但不限于攻击私人网站、套取个人信息、盗取电子资产等等。","style":10,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"112年暗网出现后，“黑网”的犯罪规模成几何倍数增长，对于其手下000等技术员的压榨也愈发严酷。\n\n112年-114年初，利用各种手段牟取了约1.5亿狄斯币的不法收入。","style":10,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"114年2月，禁闭者000因不明原因脱离该组织。失去了核心技术人员的团队一蹶不振，组织规模迅速收缩。","style":10,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"【切换场景，牢房门口】","style":18,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803006,"trial_step":6},{"step":6,"content":"总结会议结束。两位员工一边低声交谈着，一边快步离开会议室。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803007,"trial_step":7},{"step":7,"speaker":"员工B","content":"……你看行动档案了吗？受害者已全部救出，但……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803008,"trial_step":8},{"step":8,"speaker":"员工B","content":"其他那些被救出来的人……不敢想他们都经受过什么……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803009,"trial_step":9},{"step":9,"speaker":"员工A","content":"别想了，案子已经转交给治安局，看看后续处理情况吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803010,"trial_step":10},{"step":10,"speaker":"员工B","content":"哎……前段时间收押的禁闭者好像也是“黑网”的受害者，不知道……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803011,"trial_step":11},{"step":11,"content":"两人声音越来越小，最后化为一声不约而同的叹息。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803012,"trial_step":12},{"step":12,"content":"000靠在走廊尽头，似乎是刚结束一场新的恶作剧。两位员工路过她，像是不忍心，折返回来低声安慰两句，塞了几颗糖给她。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803013,"trial_step":13},{"step":13,"speaker":"000","content":"？","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803014,"trial_step":14},{"step":14,"content":"看清手里的东西后，000的笑容瞬间消失。她强硬地把糖塞回去，扭头离开。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803015,"trial_step":15},{"step":15,"speaker":"%u","content":"……","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803016,"trial_step":16},{"step":16,"content":"你在走廊的另一头目睹了一切。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803017,"trial_step":17},{"step":17,"content":"000的事情并未严格保密，不少参与行动的员工都看到了那份调查报告。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803018,"trial_step":18},{"step":18,"content":"他们为文字后代表的痛苦而难过，同情她的遭遇，怜悯她的过往。几乎所有人都多少对000表达了善意——明里暗里地照顾，包容她的恶作剧，更直白的甚至会直接去安慰她。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803019,"trial_step":19},{"step":19,"content":"只是，这种善意似乎并未起到好结果。最初的茫然过后，000似乎变得更加烦躁。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803020,"trial_step":20},{"step":20,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"……局长，行动后续报告已经出来了。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803022,"trial_step":22},{"step":21,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"我们为所有受害者进行了身体检查与心理检测，情况并不乐观。部分受害者的精神严重受创，治疗难度很大，恢复或许需要很长时间。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803023,"trial_step":23},{"step":22,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"这部分受害者已经全部转移至市医院，但……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803024,"trial_step":24},{"step":23,"options":["000状态如何？"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803025,"trial_step":25,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"000状态如何？","goto":26}]},{"step":24,"content":"夜莺摇了摇头。","style":3,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803026,"trial_step":26},{"step":25,"options":["明白了"],"style":6,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803027,"trial_step":27,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"明白了","goto":28}]},{"step":26,"speaker":"%u","content":"明白了，剩下的就交给我吧。","style":2,"background":107,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803028,"trial_step":28},{"step":27,"content":"【转场，禁闭者房间前】","style":18,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803030,"trial_step":30},{"step":28,"content":"你停在000的房间门前。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803031,"trial_step":31},{"step":29,"content":"门没有关，你能看到少女背对着门坐着。除了日光灯的嗡鸣，你听不到别的声音。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803032,"trial_step":32},{"step":30,"options":["敲敲门"],"style":6,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803033,"trial_step":33,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"敲敲门","goto":34}]},{"step":31,"speaker":"000","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803034,"trial_step":34},{"step":32,"content":"她没回头，只是一道短促的气息。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803035,"trial_step":35},{"step":33,"options":["放下手上的东西"],"style":6,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803036,"trial_step":36,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"放下手上的东西","goto":37}]},{"step":34,"speaker":"000","content":"……这是什么？","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_34"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803037,"trial_step":37},{"step":35,"speaker":"%u","content":"这段时间积攒下的派遣任务，已经积了这么厚一摞了。","style":2,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803038,"trial_step":38},{"step":36,"speaker":"%u","content":"太久不干活吃白饭，可是会被公开处刑的，没关系吗？","style":2,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803039,"trial_step":39},{"step":37,"speaker":"000","content":"……无所谓，我不在乎。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803040,"trial_step":40},{"step":38,"speaker":"%u","content":"哦？那我只好把黑网的这份任务连带前情调查一起发出去了——","style":2,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803041,"trial_step":41},{"step":39,"speaker":"000","content":"——你！","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803042,"trial_step":42},{"step":40,"content":"000猛地转头，发现你甚至都没挪动脚步——她这才意识到自己被你耍了。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803043,"trial_step":43},{"step":41,"content":"你把那一摞文件都推向000，露出下方的调查报告。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803044,"trial_step":44},{"step":42,"options":["你并非不在意自己的过去"],"style":6,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803045,"trial_step":45,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"你并非不在意自己的过去","goto":46}]},{"step":43,"content":"甚至正相反。000明显排斥那些凝视、窥探自己过往的目光，但她表现得过于抵触，以至于让人困惑。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803046,"trial_step":46},{"step":44,"content":"不是仇恨、不是痛苦。那份抵触并非投射向外，而是化为深刻的迷茫和疑惑——最终落在她自己身上。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803047,"trial_step":47},{"step":45,"speaker":"%u","content":"困扰你的并不只是这个组织。过去到底发生过什么，你在纠结什么？","style":2,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803048,"trial_step":48},{"step":46,"content":"000仍一动不动，脸被阴影笼罩看不清表情。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803049,"trial_step":49},{"step":47,"content":"过了好一会儿，她才低声笑出来。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803050,"trial_step":50},{"step":48,"speaker":"000","content":"呵呵……你想说自己跟别人不一样，你可以更懂我，更关心我，所以我该把一切告诉你，通过你重新拥抱我自己？","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803051,"trial_step":51},{"step":49,"speaker":"000","content":"好啊，那就说说吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803052,"trial_step":52},{"step":50,"content":"000猛然仰起头，直视你的双眼。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803053,"trial_step":53},{"step":51,"speaker":"000","content":"什么复仇剧苦情剧现实主义题材黑暗成长故事奔赴自由的英雄传说乒铃乓啷咚咚隆锵——随你想好了。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803054,"trial_step":54},{"step":52,"speaker":"000","content":"原本真没什么好说的——我没有那些个需要隐藏的心结，我的经历、“心路历程”远比不上你们脑海里那么的精彩热烈。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803055,"trial_step":55},{"step":53,"content":"她扬着笑，眼神却无比冰冷，她笑着靠近你，同样冰冷的手轻轻落在你的侧脸。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803056,"trial_step":56},{"step":54,"speaker":"000","content":"反正我走完，一点感觉都没有。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803057,"trial_step":57},{"step":55,"speaker":"000","content":"是，父母被人杀害，人生悲惨至极。我可怜到谁见了都痛彻心扉，想要庇护我支持我，还苦口婆心劝我别被复仇蒙了眼，说我的家人绝不希望我再为他们坠入深渊。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803058,"trial_step":58},{"step":56,"speaker":"000","content":"“哦……原来这种时候我该五内俱焚，看的想的全是复仇，哪怕赔上性命也得杀了那个老贼来平复我的悲剧吗？——那好吧。”","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803059,"trial_step":59},{"step":57,"content":"浮夸造作的语调。她像舞台上的演员，虽然讲着自己的过去，却像是在说别人的故事。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803060,"trial_step":60},{"step":58,"speaker":"000","content":"于是我杀了那个仇人，简单到毫不费力。那个晚上，好人们抱着我嚎啕大哭悲喜交加，“复仇”的同伴大笑着举枪当场绝命，要去天堂阖家团聚——哦，那时天上还下着大雨，可有气氛了。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803061,"trial_step":61},{"step":59,"speaker":"000","content":"但我是怎么回事？我一点感觉都没有。爽快？悲哀？空虚？哈，都没有。大仇得报的一刻，我甚至连父母仇人的脸都忘记了……除了莫名其妙觉醒成了禁闭者，我的日子没有一点变化。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803062,"trial_step":62},{"step":60,"speaker":"000","content":"这是禁闭者的特点吗？也不对啊，你的禁闭者们觉醒时，要么痛彻心扉、要么骤然顿悟、要么欲求亢奋……哈，这么稀里糊涂不明不白的只有我一个。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803063,"trial_step":63},{"step":61,"content":"违和感继续累积，压得你几乎喘不过气。她垂下头，强制控住你的动作，让你无法离开。像是在质问，更像是控诉。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803064,"trial_step":64},{"step":62,"speaker":"000","content":"我是在拍什么伟大电影吗？偌大个拍摄现场，只有我一个蹩脚演员——拿着主角剧本，却进入不了角色入不了戏？","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803065,"trial_step":65},{"step":63,"speaker":"000","content":"是记忆在玩弄我吗？跟那些酷炫的科幻电影一样，000只是一款仿生人，所谓记忆情感都由别人虚构好了植入她大脑，所以她的迟钝冷漠都不算错？","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_61"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803066,"trial_step":66},{"step":64,"speaker":"000","content":"要不然真相这么编：其实整个世界都只是一场虚造的游戏，而真正的我只是水缸里的大脑，是被测试的对象……哈哈，该不会现在还有人对着监视器，等着看我表演吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803067,"trial_step":67},{"step":65,"content":"她笑了好一会儿，笑容僵住了，慢慢收敛了，满眼只剩疲惫和空虚。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803068,"trial_step":68},{"step":66,"speaker":"000","content":"…………还是说，世界是对的，我的人生没有问题，你们所有人都是对的……不正常的人是我。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803069,"trial_step":69},{"step":67,"speaker":"000","content":"没法跟上正常的感情，没法跟谁产生联系，不珍惜自己的人生，所以做不到所有的理所应当。世界那么大，我却像跟它隔了层膜。是我活得不对，我才是那个错误。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803070,"trial_step":70},{"step":68,"speaker":"000","content":"哈哈……哈哈哈……没法活得正确的我，才是最大的错误……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803071,"trial_step":71},{"step":69,"options":["错的不是你"],"style":6,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803072,"trial_step":72,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"错的不是你","goto":73}]},{"step":70,"content":"侧脸仍被000捧着，力道变得很轻，但你却浑身僵硬无法挣脱。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803073,"trial_step":73},{"step":71,"content":"充当假面的笑容开始出现裂纹，逐片崩解，你这才看到里面内里灵魂的真实——","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803074,"trial_step":74},{"step":72,"content":"就和000的话语一样。那里空空荡荡，什么都没有。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803075,"trial_step":75},{"step":73,"content":"这才是被你忽视的真正症结，000需要的根本不是同情或者关怀……从一开始，她就没有接纳过<color=#fb9259>现在的自己</color>。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803076,"trial_step":76},{"step":74,"content":"眼前的人与你记忆中的身影不断重叠，又被现实尽数扯碎——最终定格在面前000那张几近落泪的脸上。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803077,"trial_step":77},{"step":75,"speaker":"000","content":"还是说，你在用这双眼睛……","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1030800},{"step":76,"speaker":"000","content":"——从我身上找谁的影子呢？","voice":["vo_trial_30801_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1030800},{"step":77,"content":"记忆的封印被情感冲击，无数碎片从缝隙中涌出，填满你的脑海。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803080,"trial_step":80},{"step":78,"content":"你记忆中的那个人——她永远仰着头，狂妄面对一切既定，永不屈服。不管这个世界怎样，哪怕只有亿万分之一的概率，她也不会否定自己存在的意义。","style":3,"background":4330,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803084,"trial_step":84},{"step":79,"content":"你之前曾想过她或许是<color=#fb9259>那个人</color>，所以她也会像<color=#fb9259>那个人</color>一样，无论遇到怎样的命定都不会感到挫败。","style":3,"background":4330,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803085,"trial_step":85},{"step":80,"options":["是我错了"],"style":6,"background":4330,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803086,"trial_step":86,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"是我错了","goto":87}]},{"step":81,"speaker":"%u","content":"那个<color=#fb9259>真正的000</color>已经彻底不在了。","style":2,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803087,"trial_step":87},{"step":82,"content":"少女脸上的笑容定格，又渐渐消失。握住你的手也缓缓放下。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803088,"trial_step":88},{"step":83,"speaker":"000","content":"FAC队长","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803089,"trial_step":89},{"step":84,"speaker":"000","content":"哈哈……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_76"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803090,"trial_step":90},{"step":85,"speaker":"000","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！你不会哭了吧？哈哈，怎么跟个小孩子丢了玩具似的，太丢人了，这就是MBCC的局长吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803091,"trial_step":91},{"step":86,"speaker":"000","content":"大家都爱戴你，你也喜欢大家，要干大事你也有觉悟干大事。看，你拿了最好的角色，最最精彩的剧本……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803092,"trial_step":92},{"step":87,"speaker":"000","content":"就别为我这个错误掉眼泪，别拧出这种表情，要是你被我传染可就不好了……来来，不哭了，我给你擦擦。","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803093,"trial_step":93},{"step":88,"content":"少女肆意地大笑，她抚上你的脸颊、眼角，想为你擦去泪水，却只摸到一片干燥。哭的人不是你。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803094,"trial_step":94},{"step":89,"speaker":"000","content":"咦？怎么会……？这是……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803095,"trial_step":95},{"step":90,"content":"泪水溢出，却是000的眼泪。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803096,"trial_step":96},{"step":91,"options":["000，难道你……"],"style":6,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803097,"trial_step":97,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"000，难道你……","goto":98}]},{"step":92,"speaker":"000","content":"真好笑……为什么连我也开始掉眼泪了……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803098,"trial_step":98},{"step":93,"speaker":"000","content":"你别再这样了……你再这样我也……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803099,"trial_step":99},{"step":94,"speaker":"000","content":"……太奇怪了……为什么……","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803100,"trial_step":100},{"step":95,"content":"眼泪滑落。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803101,"trial_step":101},{"step":96,"content":"下一秒，世界骤变。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803102,"trial_step":102},{"step":97,"content":"在眼泪砸落的地方，空间被某种力量划开，露出里侧错乱扭曲的幽灵空间。熟悉又陌生的画面涌入脑海，越来越多本不该存在的记忆重现。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803103,"trial_step":103},{"step":98,"content":"你看向名为000的少女，她同样迷茫又愕然地看着你，满眼泪水。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803104,"trial_step":104},{"step":99,"content":"空间开始破碎，错乱的风暴自虚无中涌出，缠上了你的身体。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803105,"trial_step":105},{"step":100,"speaker":"%u","content":"——！","style":2,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803106,"trial_step":106},{"step":101,"content":"你被一股无形的力量攫住，脚下一空。身体根本无法做出反应，只能眼睁睁看着自己被拽入虚空。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803107,"trial_step":107},{"step":102,"speaker":"000","content":"！抓住我！","voice":["vo_trial_30803_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_zero_trial","style":1,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803108,"trial_step":108},{"step":103,"content":"在最后一刻，少女奋力朝你伸出手。","style":3,"background":1023,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803109,"trial_step":109},{"step":104,"content":"但在指尖相触的前一秒，空间的缝隙合拢。你被黑暗彻底吞噬。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130803110,"trial_step":110}]}